If option j isn't printed out in the list of commands, then you
you are probably in discover more, not wizard mode.  If you start
in Discover mode you start with a wand of wishing, and unlimitted
lives.  If you start in wizard mode, you get unlimited wishing
and lots of other stuff.  You may or may not be authorized to 
run in wizard (debug) mode on your system.

